WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:12.291
Welcome to Mutable Dreams. two point three. New
sounds. living dreams. and a little more room

00:00:12.331 --> 00:00:16.599
to play. Take a moment... and listen.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:33.541
Twelve new Tones bring soft strings. open
choirs and breathing colours. Choose any sound

00:00:33.581 --> 00:00:40.643
on any of the six tracks. Your notes and rhythm
stay in place.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:39.455
Four Bloom Studies move from open. quiet space
to a gentle waltz and a brighter pulse. Each is

00:01:39.495 --> 00:01:44.878
a complete six-track piece. ready to make your
own.

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:58.699
Listen to the same phrase... dry. then with
reverb and delay. These are the existing

00:03:58.739 --> 00:04:05.771
effects. Shape each track’s sends. and let the
space breathe.

00:04:40.200 --> 00:04:49.848
In Terra Pluvia. notes become river rings. In
Aurora Polaris. six voices light three ribbons.

00:04:49.888 --> 00:04:55.578
The music leads the picture. The original
garden stays.

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:56.619
Meters settle more steadily. More controls
speak to the screen reader. Press Play again to

00:05:56.659 --> 00:06:03.857
give a late MIDI clock a fresh wait. Back up
your own Biomes before updating.

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:29.340
Explore Performance Garden for VIBE FM. the MPC
preview. and our handheld and SMK Elite

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:40.104
projects. There is TrackWerk and bazillOS too.
Each edition has its own compatibility notes.

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:28.618
Mutable Dreams FM carries the music into radio
and visual streams. Free and open source. by

00:07:28.658 --> 00:07:36.621
Kid Bunka. Find the instruments. guides. and
optional support on our website.
